      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. MONTOYA: No, that's not the only reason. If -- if I understand your question, Justice Scalia, it's not only a question of reasonable accommodation, it's also a question of whether or not he's the most qualified. It's also a question of whether or not he constitutes a direct threat or his rehiring would give rise to an undue hardship or was justified by a business necessity."
